WEBVTT

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.080
Damn wraith! You finally showed yourself!

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.090
What happened to Gisen-san and Nia-san?

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.050
They're safe.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.790
Or at least that's what we can hope for.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.110
Are you all okay?

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:30.680
Yeah.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.250
It walked away?

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.280
Perhaps it doesn't think we're worth its time.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.990
It's headed for my brother's barrier!

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.450
It must be in the safest place on the campus.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.530
The chamber under the main castle!

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:52.830
That's why Yoshihiko put his base there,

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.290
so he could focus on repairing the barrier.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.490
We're going after it!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.130
Yes!

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:02.210
If we don't stop it, the future of Great Japan is in danger!

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:03.530
Precisely!

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.060
So where are they?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.270
Dammit!

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.310
What did Yuki say?

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.030
No one knows where d'Artagnan and Gisen are.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:23.530
Huh?

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.660
The monster's heading toward the castle to destroy the barrier.

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:30.450
So that barrier is our last hope?

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.960
Here it comes.

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:40.840
Even if it's a great monstrosity, it's still just a wraith.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:41.340
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:43.340
We only have to finish the repairs to the barrier.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:43.840
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:48.340
Repairs must be completed before this place is demolished!

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:56.100
What are you doing to my castle?!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.210
Milady! Please wait!

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:00.650
This isn't any ordinary opponent!

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.980
Black Thunder Fang!

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.450
How's that?

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.620
You fool!

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.330
Damn you!

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:25.730
Milady!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:26.960
Stop it, Hanzou!

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.760
We can't even get close to it?

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:40.400
Oh no!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.520
Hanzou!

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.440
Milady...

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.530
please forgive me.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.030
N-No!

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:51.530
Hanzou!

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:56.040
Wake up! I won't let you die!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.620
Sorry, Hanzou.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:02.380
I'm already...

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.390
D-Don't tell me.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.490
S-Sen...

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.270
Their qi is vanishing.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.270
No way.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.100
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.170
Their qi...

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.360
Hanzou-san! Princess Sen!

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.650
Please, say something!

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.860
This is the worst possible scenario.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.010
Yukimura-sama, we need to retreat for now!

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.750
And then what?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.060
If the barrier breaks, Great Japan is done for.

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:58.720
But...

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:03.230
We're the only ones who can do something right now!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:07.730
Even if it's a one in a million chance! Even if it's one in a billion!

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:09.730
I will stand by you.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.740
I'm going to use my strongest move to stop its spear.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:17.120
Ultimate Diamond Defense Barrier!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.760
Get out of my way!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.490
There's no time to rest.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.780
I'll take it from here.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:02.690
I can't let Yukimura take all the glory!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.000
Crap!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:08.750
No!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.260
I'll help you, monkey!

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:16.380
But I can't abandon you.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:21.640
I'll die too.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.140
Kanetsugu! Sasuke!

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.940
Yukimura-sama, please run!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.200
We can't-

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:37.700
Matabei!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.330
At this rate, it'll break through our defenses.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.750
Impossible!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.840
Even the Master Samurai can't buy us time?

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:10.860
Matabei-san... Yukimura...

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:13.360
N-No way...

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:15.940
Are they all dead?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:19.360
How dare you fucking touch them!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.620
Onii-chan!

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:25.490
Muneakira!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.750
I'll avenge them all!

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.820
Give up, Muneakira.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.590
We can't let <i>you</i> die too.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.560
Onii-chan!

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.220
Damn you, fucking beast!

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.020
Impossible.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.570
They've all fallen.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:59.110
He was our last hope.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.780
What are you doing?

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.750
Get on with the repairs already!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.080
Don't let their deaths be in vain!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:09.790
No matter what, we have to protect Great Japan!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.630
How dare...

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.290
How dare you take Onii-chan.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.830
How dare you take Yuki... Beta-san...

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:23.170
Princess Sen... Hanzou-san...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.180
Gutsugutsu-san... Sacchin...

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.390
Juubei!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.320
You'll pay!

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:42.110
Stop it! You don't have the strength left to fight!

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.200
Yagyuu Juubei.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:51.870
And here I thought you used up all your power against Musashi.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.880
If you can still fight this much...

00:07:56.540 --> 00:08:00.590
it means you're no mere human!

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.930
Juubei!

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.430
<b>The barrier</b>

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.180
<b>is broken</b>

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.820
The first line of defense has been broken.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.900
Thirteen minutes until it reaches us.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:24.630
Twenty minutes until the barrier is repaired!

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.230
We won't make it!

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.290
Don't give up! Hurry with the repairs!

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.410
Juubei! Juubei!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.000
What's that?

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:42.990
A charm?

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:45.840
Inko-chan!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:48.570
I'm so glad we could meet again!

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.030
Let's play together!

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:50.890
We can't.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.430
Kill me.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:56.430
Why are you saying that?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.150
You're my friend, aren't you?

00:08:58.150 --> 00:08:59.710
Yes.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.400
That's why I'm asking you.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.570
I want to rest in peace.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:07.910
Kill me and save their souls.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.910
I don't want to be used anymore.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:14.710
There's no way I could do that!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:20.250
Onii-chan and all the others died too.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.870
We're all done for!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.250
It's not over yet.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.680
Yagyuu Muneakira is still alive.

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.470
He is?

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:33.320
Only you can stop the wraith now.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:34.180
But...

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:35.910
I'll be waiting.

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:45.410
I won't let you die.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:50.610
Only you and Juubei can stop that wraith now!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:55.830
Onii-chan!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.330
Don't die!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.330
Looks like we still have a chance.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.340
Maedake-san, please! Save him!

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:05.630
I know. Just a little longer!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.090
For a good partner

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.330
What are you doing?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.970
No matter what, it's over.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:17.310
You wasted your power to save such a lousy Master Samurai.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.910
Maedake-san!

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.410
I'm fine.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.430
How's Muneakira?

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:38.000
I've given him all my qi.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.170
The rest is up to him.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.950
The Samurai Bride...

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:46.850
Could a Samurai Bride defeat it?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.250
Honestly, I don't know.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.760
For some reason, everyone has the impression that a Samurai Bride

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.020
is something far stronger than a Master Samurai.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:59.180
I don't think that's true, though.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:04.230
If she were stronger, they'd have called her "King" or "Great"

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:06.440
or even something flashy.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.730
But instead, they chose "Bride."

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.950
It's like a wedding.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:15.950
She must be one who's worthy enough to <i>be</i> a bride.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:19.330
Worthy to be a bride?

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:24.790
I'm going to go lie down for a bit.

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:27.380
No! Don't leave me alone!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:29.130
Don't worry.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.800
You can become one,

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:32.130
a real Samurai Bride.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.890
Maedake-san!

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:43.350
It's broken through the 25th line of defense!

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.570
Only three minutes left!

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.440
Four until the barrier's ready!

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:48.730
Just a bit longer...

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:50.030
I hope we can make it.

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:53.190
Stop! Please, stop!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:56.280
Please, just let Inko-chan rest!

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:59.290
J-Juubei...

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.080
Onii-chan!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.290
Thank goodness you're all right.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:05.500
Yeah!

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.580
Juubei.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.670
You should escape.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:12.050
We don't stand a chance anymore.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:15.310
No. Inko-chan told me.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:17.430
If we can get there,

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.390
then Inko-chan can set everyone free!

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:25.400
So please, let me help you one more time. Please!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.230
All right.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:32.230
Let's fight our last battle together.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:42.990
It's broken through the 28th line of defense!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.370
Two minutes until it reaches here!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.500
What about the barrier?
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.000
Three minutes until it's ready!
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.840
So we won't make it?

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.550
I'll hold back the wraith.

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:57.050
No matter what happens, you must continue repairing the barrier!

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:57.840
Understood?

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:58.850
Yes, sir!

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.270
Onii-chan, please!

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:19.370
You fools.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:21.630
Do you have a death wish?!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.040
What?!

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.050
There she is!

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.250
Inko-chan!

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.970
She's different from before.

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:40.870
Be careful, Juubei!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.370
You were able to escape before,

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.600
but <i>now</i> you came back of your own free will?

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.980
Inko-chan, what's wrong?

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:49.980
No.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.610
She's possessed by the wraith!

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:55.320
You won't get away this time, Yagyuu Juubei!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:58.770
Dammit! We're surrounded!

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:03.410
You and this country are done for.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:08.870
What?!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.540
We're not done yet!

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.710
The last shield is <i>me</i>!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.870
Back to work!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.720
Continue the repairs!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:22.180
That's right! Yoshihiko-sama is putting his life on the line!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.300
We can't just run away!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.060
Continue the repairs!

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:34.170
Now, become one with us.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.360
No way!

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:40.450
You two okay?

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.240
Are you here to help, Muneakira, Juubei?

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.910
Princess Sen...

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:45.830
Yukki!

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.250
There you are.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.530
We've finally found you.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.650
They still haven't been absorbed?

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.510
Their will is so strong.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:59.190
Time for our counterattack!

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.630
Girls, are you ready?

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:01.510
Yeah!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.650
Wait!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:06.520
I didn't come here to fight.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.630
I came to save Inko-chan and everyone else.

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.520
Both the living and the dead.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.530
So please, don't fight!

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:19.610
But how can we save them without fighting?

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:23.900
I don't know! But that's something we have to do!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:24.740
Juubei...

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.910
I don't really understand,

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.000
but that's something you would say.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:31.750
It's a totally baseless assumption, so I guess you can do it.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.270
We already died once.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:35.750
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:40.010
Juubei-san, Muneakira-san, I trust you.

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:43.530
I guess I can tag along with your fun too.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.720
W-Wow!

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.600
Your qi's flowing into me as one.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:51.980
Now I'm certain!

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.610
Juubei, you're the chosen one!

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:58.110
This is the birth of the Samurai Bride!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.780
Onii-chan...

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.790
Become my Samurai Bride.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:23.380
Blossoming Flower! Samurai Bride!

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:33.230
We won't let you!

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:34.850
Not a chance!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.030
Let's do this, Juubei.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:37.610
Yeah!

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:39.860
Blossoming Flower!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:49.910
Wh-What is this warm light?

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.550
I have no idea, but it feels great!

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:57.380
The wraiths are leaving their bodies?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.380
So now I can rest in peace?

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.670
Indeed.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:07.390
I think that deep down inside, I was wishing for this.

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:09.640
Let's go, Juubei.

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:10.890
Inshun's right there.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.270
Dragon Blade!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.780
Stop!

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.780
Stay away!

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:34.120
Damn! We can't get any closer!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.330
Juubei! Go to Inshun by yourself!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:42.250
Inko-chan, I'm gonna free you!

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.260
No way!

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:55.390
Our hatred has been purged!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.400
You really came.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:00.600
Of course!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.400
I mean, we <i>are</i> friends.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.900
Now I can finally rest in peace.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.780
Good night, Inko-chan.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:09.910
Thank you, Juubei.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:11.950
We'll meet again!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:12.910
Yeah!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.190
You did it?

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.930
You sure took your sweet-ass time.

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:36.180
The wraith blob is disappearing.

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:39.520
They did it! They protected the barrier!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.690
Not yet!

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:42.940
The signal hasn't disappeared yet!

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:44.230
That can't be!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.240
How dare you...

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:50.740
How dare you do this to me?!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.110
Impossible!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:56.240
There are souls that can't be laid to rest even when hit by the Samurai Bride's light?

00:18:56.240 --> 00:19:00.500
Now, I'll just have to kill you!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:01.750
Mucchan!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:02.370
No way!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.670
Feel the wrath of my strongest minion!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.340
Juubei.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.640
Putting Musashi to rest won't be easy.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:16.220
I know.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.650
Keep an eye on me, Onii-chan.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.940
Give it all you've got, Juubei!

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:05.210
Juubei!

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:08.440
Show her the power of trust and love!

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.210
Purifying Death!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:28.790
What?!

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:43.770
Did she?

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:50.190
You're strong, Yagyuu Juubei.

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:52.630
Let's duel again sometime, Mucchan.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:53.780
Yeah.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.740
But I won't lose next time.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:07.210
The flow of qi in Great Japan has returned to normal!

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:09.460
Repairs to the barrier have been completed!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:12.590
Indeed. Good work.

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:16.090
The trapped souls have been freed too.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.050
That's Onee-sama for you!

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.600
I knew she could do it!

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:24.100
But one day, I will be like that too.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:29.110
So once again, we were saved by Yagyuu Muneakira's samurai?

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.690
Maedake-san!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:33.610
I'm glad you're okay.

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:37.110
And it's not just me.

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:40.120
Look!

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:43.790
We were revived?

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.620
Looks like it.

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:47.630
I'm so glad!

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.000
I'm invincible.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.490
But you're still dead.

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:58.130
Hurray! Everyone's back!

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.720
Everyone!

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.140
Welcome back!

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:04.290
I'm so glad. Really!
